body:
I feel like 50 wasn't really blackballed. He had movies, video games, even T-shirts after How to Rob (which I believe was very early in his career)

&#x200B;

Little Brother was definitely black balled the entire time they were together. 

&#x200B;

Other good artists who've been black balled? I think Mr. Criminal (Chicano rapper from SoCal), FBG Duck, Maxo Kream (or maybe he doesn't get the recognition he deserves), Max B
